@refreshToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6ImNtb2lwMDRwOTAwMDNjcDR1OXphc3VndTEiLCJyb2xlIjoiU0hPUF9PV05FUiIsImlhdCI6MTc3NzQ1OTM0MCwiZXhwIjoxNzc4MDY0MTQwfQ.4VigMHWQQu7w9uhy8Xx-7oqA_AXtZovyjuoFVsBcOZ0


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  S2 — Auth
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════

### S2.3 — Request OTP (sends WhatsApp message)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{myPhone}}"
}

###

### S2.4a — Register as Customer (first time)
# Run request-otp first, then paste the code you received
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{myPhone}}",
  "otp": "44",
  "name": "Ahmed",
  "isRegister": true
}

###

### S2.4b — Register as Shop Owner (first time)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{myPhone}}",
  "otp": "775757",
  "name": "Ahmed",
  "shopName": "My Barbershop",
  "isRegister": true
}

###

### S2.4c — Login (existing user)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{myPhone}}",
  "otp": "449324"
}

###

### S2.5 — Refresh access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### S2.6 — Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### S2.7 — Get current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  S3 — Shops & Discovery
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════

### S3.4 — Create shop (Owner JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shops
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameEn": "My Barbershop",
  "nameAr": "حلاقتي",
  "address": "Test St",
  "city": "Baghdad",
  "neighborhood": "Karrada",
  "neighborhoodAr": "الكرادة",
  "phone": "+9647802431955",
  "lat": 33.34,
  "lng": 44.40
}

###

### S3.5 — Update shop (Owner JWT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/shops/cmojy02aa000084w9i2lkeii1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameEn": "My Barbershop Updated",
  "city": "Baghdad"
}

###

### S3.6a — Upload cover (Owner JWT)
# Put any JPEG/PNG/WebP image at the path below (e.g. save one as test.jpg next to this file)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shops/cmojy02aa000084w9i2lkeii1/cover
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test.png
------Boundary--

###

### S3.6b — Upload logo (Owner JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shops/cmojy02aa000084w9i2lkeii1/logo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test.png
------Boundary--

###

### S3.2 — List shops (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops

###

### S3.2 — List shops with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops?search=barber&city=Baghdad&priceRange=MID&limit=20&offset=0

###

### S3.2 — List shops with distance (provide your GPS coords)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops?lat=33.34&lng=44.40

###

### S3.3 — Get shop detail (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops/cmojy02aa000084w9i2lkeii1

###

### S2.10 — Get shop approval status (Owner JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shop/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### S2.9a — Generate barber invite (Owner JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/invite/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameEn": "Ahmed",
  "nameAr": "أحمد"
}

###

### S2.9b — Get invite info (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/invite?code=PASTE_CODE_HERE

###

### S2.9c — Accept invite (public — barber completes OTP first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/invite/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "PASTE_CODE_HERE",
  "phone": "{{myPhone}}",
  "otp": "PASTE_OTP_HERE"
}

###

### Health check
GET http://localhost:4000/health

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  S4 — Services CRUD
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════

@shopId = cmojy02aa000084w9i2lkeii1

### S4.1a — List services (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/services

###

### S4.1b — Create service (Owner JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameEn": "Haircut",
  "nameAr": "قص شعر",
  "price": 5000,
  "durationMin": 30,
  "category": "cut"
}

###

### S4.1c — Update service (Owner JWT) — paste serviceId after creating
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/services/cmok9f9j8000311e94ksbuupg
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 7500,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### S4.1d — Delete service (Owner JWT)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/services/PASTE_SERVICE_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### S4.4a — List barbers (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/barbers

###

### S4.4b — Create barber (Owner JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/barbers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameEn": "Ahmed",
  "nameAr": "أحمد",
  "experienceYears": 5,
  "specialties": ["fade", "beard"]
}

###

### S4.4c — Update barber — paste barberId after creating
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/barbers/PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "experienceYears": 8
}

###

### S4.4d — Deactivate barber
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/barbers/PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### S4.5 — Set barber schedule (replaces entire schedule)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/barbers/cmokeuby1000113aidfuhg04n/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "dayOfWeek": 0, "startTime": "09:10", "endTime": "17:00", "isAvailable": true },
  { "dayOfWeek": 1, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00", "isAvailable": true },
  { "dayOfWeek": 2, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00", "isAvailable": true },
  { "dayOfWeek": 3, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00", "isAvailable": true },
  { "dayOfWeek": 4, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00", "isAvailable": true },
  { "dayOfWeek": 5, "startTime": "10:00", "endTime": "14:00", "isAvailable": true },
  { "dayOfWeek": 6, "startTime": "00:00", "endTime": "00:00", "isAvailable": false }
]

###

### S4.6a — Upload portfolio photo (multipart/form-data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/barbers/PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE/portfolio
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test.png
------Boundary--

###

### S4.6b — Delete portfolio photo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/barbers/PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE/portfolio/PASTE_PHOTO_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### S4.6c — Reorder portfolio photos
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/barbers/PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE/portfolio/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "photoIds": ["PHOTO_ID_1", "PHOTO_ID_2"]
}

###

### S4.7a — Barber public profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/barbers/PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE

###

### S4.7b — Barber availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/barbers/PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE/availability

###

### S4.7c — Barber portfolio (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/barbers/PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE/portfolio

###

### S4.7d — Barber reviews (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/barbers/PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE/reviews?page=1&limit=10

###

### S4.8a — List shop reviews (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/reviews?page=1&limit=10

###

### S4.8b — Create review (Customer JWT) — paste a real bookingId
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "PASTE_BOOKING_ID_HERE",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Great haircut, very professional!",
  "barberId": "PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE"
}

###

### S4.8c — Flag a review (Owner JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews/PASTE_REVIEW_ID_HERE/flag
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "SPAM"
}

###

### S4.8d — Resolve flag (Admin JWT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reviews/PASTE_REVIEW_ID_HERE/flag
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "remove",
  "removalReason": "Confirmed spam content"
}

###

### ─── S5.1 — Availability ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### S5.1a — Get shop availability (no auth, regular window = 3 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops/PASTE_SHOP_ID_HERE/availability?date=2025-06-15
###

### S5.1b — Get shop availability for a specific barber
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops/PASTE_SHOP_ID_HERE/availability?date=2025-06-15&barberId=PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE
###

### S5.1c — Get availability as VIP (7-day window)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops/PASTE_SHOP_ID_HERE/availability?date=2025-06-20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### ─── S5.3-5 — Create Booking ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### S5.3a — Create booking (Customer JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopId": "PASTE_SHOP_ID_HERE",
  "barberId": "PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE",
  "serviceIds": ["PASTE_SERVICE_ID_HERE"],
  "slot": "2025-12-15T10:00:00.000Z",
  "paymentMethod": "ZAINCASH"
}
###

### ─── S7 — Queue Management ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### S7.1 — Get shop queue (Owner/Barber JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops/PASTE_SHOP_ID_HERE/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S7.2 — Add walk-in to queue (Owner/Barber JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shops/PASTE_SHOP_ID_HERE/queue/walk-in
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ahmed Walk-In",
  "serviceIds": ["PASTE_SERVICE_ID_HERE"],
  "barberId": "PASTE_BARBER_ID_HERE",
  "isVip": false
}
###

### S7.3 — Customer: check own queue position (Customer JWT, paste bookingId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/queue/PASTE_BOOKING_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S7.4 — Start service / seat customer (Owner/Barber JWT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/queue/PASTE_ENTRY_ID_HERE/start
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S7.5 — Mark done (Owner/Barber JWT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/queue/PASTE_ENTRY_ID_HERE/done
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S7.6 — Mark no-show (Owner/Barber JWT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/queue/PASTE_ENTRY_ID_HERE/no-show
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S7.7 — Reorder queue entry (Owner JWT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/queue/PASTE_ENTRY_ID_HERE/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "position": 2
}
###

### ─── S8 — Booking History + Reviews ───────────────────────────────────────

### S8.1 — List my bookings (Customer JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S8.2 — Get single booking receipt (Customer JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/PASTE_BOOKING_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S8.3 — Cancel booking (Customer JWT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/PASTE_BOOKING_ID_HERE/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S8.4 — Create review with optional photos (Customer JWT, multipart/form-data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bookingId"

PASTE_BOOKING_ID_HERE
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="rating"

5
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="comment"

Great service!
------Boundary--
###

### ─── S9 — Dashboard Analytics ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### S9.1 — Dashboard stats (Owner/Barber JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S9.2 — Dashboard activity feed (Owner JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S9.3a — Analytics: this month (Owner/Barber JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics?range=month
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S9.3b — Analytics: today
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics?range=today
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S9.3c — Analytics: custom range
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics?range=custom&start=2025-11-01&end=2025-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### S9.4 — Per-barber analytics (Owner JWT only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/barbers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###
